    <p class="ch-lead">Grooves is <strong>creative ecosystems</strong>. An ideal toward a revolution in the music and creative industries. Music becomes a <strong>tradable object of value</strong>, with properties that are <strong>not only audible but infinite</strong> — shaped by the artist and what each work seeks.</p>

