      <p>If ten artists do it, it's an anecdote. If a thousand do it, it's a trend. If an entire generation of creators decides their art is more than a "stream," more than a rental — that real, tangible creative ecosystems can be built — it's a revolution. <strong>Grooves will not change the music industry. The artists who believe in this idea will change the music industry. Grooves is a tool.</strong></p>
